"scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"76348","synopsis":"Shiki Tsubasa has just moved from Tokyo to the city of Kitami in Hokkaido. When he gets lost, a flirty gal named Fuyuki Minami points him in the right direction. After the two meet again at school, Minami invites Tsubasa to hang out with her at home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yab8WrkxvmJwfz8Ely9UzGadisA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"76439","synopsis":"Tsubasa decides to attend the Kitami Winter Festival with Minami. Tsubasa is nervous and wonders if it classifies as a date. Some days later, during lunch, Minami asks if she can go to Tsubasa's house. On their way there the two come upon a snow mound.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kg4cnBiliNK6TNUjcWB0UOoj5qb.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"76537","synopsis":"Tsubasa starts learning to ski on a class trip to the slopes. He's told to partner with Akino Sayuri, a pretty loner that Minami is fascinated with. When he runs to the bus to grab his chopsticks for lunch, he finds Akino half-naked and covered in sweat.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mI6bcLKTdtPpTkMgMi2dGyVGRCw.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"76629","synopsis":"Tsubasa tries walking to school in a blizzard, but Minami and her flirty mother pick him up. After class, Tsubasa, Minami, and Sayuri hang out at a big shopping center. Later that night, Minami shocks Tsubasa with a steaming hot video call from the bath.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xP3fD1hIVtkXc4o16oUMIFiGJxr.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"76868","synopsis":"Tsubasa's classmates at karaoke are excited for Valentine's Day. Sayuri says she isn't interested but later bumps into Minami while gazing at the Valentine's display from afar. She then decides to ask Minami a question.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m5raWZ9kmcCJ0zeufLHUuyaBUYJ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"76956","synopsis":"Tsubasa, Sayuri, and Minami have a study party. Tsubasa loses track of time and is scolded when he gets home late. The next day, Tsubasa bumps into the breathtaking Rena-senpai on his way to school and is soon shocked to realize that she is his neighbor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fPF1fjoSs6tZWgjUuKBIEkGpjjA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"77240","synopsis":"Tsubasa is ordered to score high on exams, so when the lovely Rena offers to tutor him, he accepts. He soon realizes that Rena expects a reward for her help. Minami spots them together and is thrilled at first, but then starts to feel very uncomfortable.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3DTp4fHhR27k2c5ce1Ws2dSrXQY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"77564","synopsis":"Minami and Sayuri race to the scene of Tsubasa and Reina's date. After being moved to tears over the movie heroine's story, Reina tells Tsubasa about her own circumstances. Tsubasa, having been reminded of his own situation, then tells her his story.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dDndAqCERN9oJldaVjLK5E4ephw.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"77816","synopsis":"Matsuo, a class friend who made amends with Minami, takes Tsubasa smelt fishing as a thank you for his consultation. Minami, who happened to be at the fishing spot, joins them, and they discuss makeup. Later, Minami visits Tsubasa who's caught a cold.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tNVuJ50dSqxNrUvDbnL0fPNpOsC.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53421","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"213181","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"426410","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"78038","synopsis":"The new term begins. Minami catches Tsubasa on the way to class and starts teasing him ruthlessly. The two are thrilled to learn they are in the same class again, but Minami still seems gloomy. After school, Minami says she has something to tell Tsubasa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bg6bzw2fZLJYu37JSheofpTH8FP.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17682","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155963","episodeNumbers":[1